## 6. Branch protection & remote naming

| Remote       | URL                                                  | Purpose                                  |
|--------------|------------------------------------------------------|------------------------------------------|
| `origin`     | `git@github.com:nomaan02/captain-system.git`         | Primary private repo (Nomaan only)       |
| `multi-user` | `git@github.com:nomaan02/captain-multi-user.git`     | Shared repo for multi-instance towers    |

`main` is the only deployment branch. Feature branches are local-only unless
explicitly pushed. PR-style review is not used in this repo — small fixes
land directly on `main` after passing the static lint+test gate
(`scripts/lint_decimal_boundary.py` + the regression suite in
`docs2/quick-fixes/fixing-decimal-errors/TOWER_VALIDATION_RUNBOOK_FINAL.md` §1).

